ling an AWS Lambda function to process the files once each hour</span><span class=\"sm-opt-m\"></span></button><button class=\"sm-opt\" data-ltr=\"C\" type=\"button\"><span class=\"sm-opt-l\">C</span><span class=\"sm-opt-t\">Send the JSON files to an Amazon S3 bucket. Configure an AWS Lambda function with an S3 event source to process the S3 objects.</span><span class=\"sm-opt-m\"></span></button><button class=\"sm-opt\" data-ltr=\"D\" type=\"button\"><span class=\"sm-opt-l\">D</span><span class=\"sm-opt-t\">Sending the JSON files to an Amazon S3 bucket and scheduling an AWS Lambda function to process the S3 objects once each hour</span><span class=\"sm-opt-m\"></span></button></div><div class=\"sm-check-fb\" style=\"display:none\"></div><div class=\"sm-source\"><i class=\"fa-solid fa-circle-question\"></i> Knowledge check &middot; Exam Strategy Session 1 Answer Key</div></div>",
