    "n": 5,
    "mode": "native",
    "native": "<div class=\"slide-native sm-skill sm-check\" style=\"--accent:var(--aws-blue);\" data-correct=\"D\" data-multi=\"\" data-rationale=\"This option does not address the security concern, as it would still require the EC2 instance to access S3 over the public Internet, which poses a security risk.\" data-judge=\"{&quot;prompt&quot;: &quot;An application running on Amazon EC2 instances processes sensitive information stored on Amazon S3. The information is accessed over the Internet. The security team is concerned that the Amazon EC2 instance connectivity to the to Amazon S3 bucket is a security risk. Which solution will resolve the security concern?&quot;, &quot;options&quot;: [&quot;Configuring the EC2 instance to access the data through an Internet Gateway&quot;, &quot;Configuring the EC2 instance to access the data through a VPN connection&quot;, &quot;Configuring the EC2 instance to access the data through a NAT Gateway&quot;, &quot;Configure the EC2 instance to access the data through a VPC endpoint for Amazon S3.&quot;], &quot;answer&quot;: &quot;Configure the EC2 instance to access the data through a VPC endpoint for Amazon S3.&quot;, &quot;why&quot;: &quot;This option does not address the security concern, as it would still require the EC2 instance to access S3 over the public Internet, which poses a security risk.&quot;, &quot;explanations&quot;: {&quot;A&quot;: &quot;This option does not address the security concern, as it would still require the EC2 instance to access S3 over the public Internet, which poses a security risk.&quot;, &quot;B&quot;: &quot;While a VPN connection can provide secure access to resources over the Internet, it does not eliminate the security risk associated with accessing S3 over the public Internet.&quot;, &quot;C&quot;: &quot;NAT Gateway allows instances in a private subnet to initiate outbound traffic to the Internet, but it does not provide a secure way to access resources like Amazon S3.&quot;, &quot;D&quot;: &quot;&quot;}}\"><div class=\"kicker\">SESSION 1 &middot; KNOWLEDGE CHECK &middot; QUESTION 4 of 6</div><h2>Check yourself <span class=\"sm-check-hint\">click an option</span></h2><p class=\"sm-check-q\">An application running on Amazon EC2 instances processes sensitive information stored on Amazon S3. The information is accessed over the Internet. The security team is concerned that the Amazon EC2 instance connectivity to the to Amazon S3 bucket is a security risk. Which solution will resolve the security concern?</p><div class=\"sm-opts\"><button class=\"sm-opt\" data-ltr=\"A\" type=\"button\"><span class=\"sm-opt-l\">A</span><span class=\"sm-opt-t\">Configuring the EC2 instance to access the data through an Internet Gateway</span><span class=\"sm-opt-m\"></span></button><button class=\"sm-opt\" data-ltr=\"B\" type=\"button\"><span class=\"sm-opt-l\">B</span><span class=\"sm-opt-t\">Configuring the EC2 instance to access the data through a VPN connection</span><span class=\"sm-opt-m\"></span></button><button class=\"sm-opt\" data-ltr=\"C\" type=\"button\"><span class=\"sm-opt-l\">C</span><span class=\"sm-opt-t\">Configuring the EC2 instance to access the data through a NAT Gateway</span><span class=\"sm-opt-m\"></span></button><button class=\"sm-opt\" data-ltr=\"D\" type=\"button\"><span class=\"sm-opt-l\">D</span><span class=\"sm-opt-t\">Configure the EC2 instance to access the data through a VPC endpoint for Amazon S3.</span><span class=\"sm-opt-m\"></span></button></div><div class=\"sm-check-fb\" style=\"display:none\"></div><div class=\"sm-source\"><i class=\"fa-solid fa-circle-question\"></i> Knowledge check &middot; Exam Strategy Session 1 Answer Key</div></div>",
