    "native": "<div class=\"slide-native sm-skill sm-check\" style=\"--accent:var(--aws-blue);\" data-correct=\"A\" data-multi=\"\" data-rationale=\"This option specifies that access to GetItem is allowed only if the request is initiated from the specified VPC within the specified time frame.\" data-judge=\"{&quot;prompt&quot;: &quot;A security engineer attached the following IAM policy to a developer&#x27;s IAM user account: { \\&quot;Version\\&quot;: \\&quot;2012-10-17\\&quot;, \\&quot;Statement\\&quot;: { \\&quot;Effect\\&quot;: \\&quot;Allow\\&quot;, \\&quot;Action\\&quot;: \\&quot;dynamodb:GetItem\\&quot;, \\&quot;Resource\\&quot;: \\&quot;*\\&quot;, \\&quot;Condition\\&quot;: { \\&quot;DateGreaterThan\\&quot;: { \\&quot;aws:CurrentTime\\&quot;: \\&quot;2020-07-01T00:00:00Z\\&quot; }, \\&quot;DateLessThan\\&quot;: { \\&quot;aws:CurrentTime\\&quot;: \\&quot;2020-12-31T23:59:59Z\\&quot; }, \\&quot;StringEquals\\&quot;: { \\&quot;aws:SourceVpc\\&quot;: \\&quot;vpc-111bbb22\\&quot; } } } } Which permission will the developer have for using GetItem?&quot;, &quot;options&quot;: [&quot;Access is allowed on or between July 1, 2020, and December 31, 2020 (UTC), and if the request is initiated from vpc-111bbb22&quot;, &quot;Access is allowed on or between July 1, 2020, and December 31, 2020 (UTC), or if the request is initiated from vpc-111bbb22&quot;, &quot;Access is allowed on or between July 1, 2020, and December 31, 2020 (UTC), and if the request uses a VPC endpoint in vpc-111bbb22&quot;, &quot;Access is allowed on or between July 1, 2020, and December 31, 2020 (UTC), or if the request uses a VPC endpoint in vpc-111bbb22&quot;], &quot;answer&quot;: &quot;Access is allowed on or between July 1, 2020, and December 31, 2020 (UTC), and if the request is initiated from vpc-111bbb22&quot;, &quot;why&quot;: &quot;This option specifies that access to GetItem is allowed only if the request is initiated from the specified VPC within the specified time frame.&quot;, &quot;explanations&quot;: {&quot;A&quot;: &quot;This option specifies that access to GetItem is allowed only if the request is initiated from the specified VPC within the specified time frame.&quot;, &quot;B&quot;: &quot;This option implies that access is granted if either the time condition or the VPC condition is met, which does not align with the IAM policy provided.&quot;, &quot;C&quot;: &quot;This option introduces the concept of a VPC endpoint, which is not mentioned in the IAM policy.&quot;, &quot;D&quot;: &quot;Similar to option C, this option also introduces the concept of a VPC endpoint, which is not specified in the IAM policy.&quot;}}\"><div class=\"kicker\">SESSION 1 &middot; KNOWLEDGE CHECK &middot; QUESTION 6 of 6</div><h2>Check yourself <span class=\"sm-check-hint\">click an option</span></h2><p class=\"sm-check-q\">A security engineer attached the following IAM policy to a developer&#x27;s IAM user account: { &quot;Version&quot;: &quot;2012-10-17&quot;, &quot;Statement&quot;: { &quot;Effect&quot;: &quot;Allow&quot;, &quot;Action&quot;: &quot;dynamodb:GetItem&quot;, &quot;Resource&quot;: &quot;*&quot;, &quot;Condition&quot;: { &quot;DateGreaterThan&quot;: { &quot;aws:CurrentTime&quot;: &quot;2020-07-01T00:00:00Z&quot; }, &quot;DateLessThan&quot;: { &quot;aws:CurrentTime&quot;: &quot;2020-12-31T23:59:59Z&quot; }, &quot;StringEquals&quot;: { &quot;aws:SourceVpc&quot;: &quot;vpc-111bbb22&quot; } } } } Which permission will the developer have for using GetItem?</p><div class=\"sm-opts\"><button class=\"sm-opt\" data-ltr=\"A\" type=\"button\"><span class=\"sm-opt-l\">A</span><span class=\"sm-opt-t\">Access is allowed on or between July 1, 2020, and December 31, 2020 (UTC), and if the request is initiated from vpc-111bbb22</span><span class=\"sm-opt-m\"></span></button><button class=\"sm-opt\" data-ltr=\"B\" type=\"button\"><span class=\"sm-opt-l\">B</span><span class=\"sm-opt-t\">Access is allowed on or between July 1, 2020, and December 31, 2020 (UTC), or if the request is initiated from vpc-111bbb22</span><span class=\"sm-opt-m\"></span></button><button class=\"sm-opt\" data-ltr=\"C\" type=\"button\"><span class=\"sm-opt-l\">C</span><span class=\"sm-opt-t\">Access is allowed on or between July 1, 2020, and December 31, 2020 (UTC), and if the request uses a VPC endpoint in vpc-111bbb22</span><span class=\"sm-opt-m\"></span></button><button class=\"sm-opt\" data-ltr=\"D\" type=\"button\"><span class=\"sm-opt-l\">D</span><span class=\"sm-opt-t\">Access is allowed on or between July 1, 2020, and December 31, 2020 (UTC), or if the request uses a VPC endpoint in vpc-111bbb22</span><span class=\"sm-opt-m\"></span></button></div><div class=\"sm-check-fb\" style=\"display:none\"></div><div class=\"sm-source\"><i class=\"fa-solid fa-circle-question\"></i> Knowledge check &middot; Exam Strategy Session 1 Answer Key</div></div>",
